  "nativeAdaptation": [
    "12 independent ButtonGroup source examples plus the inline ButtonGroupText example form 13 configurations. Avatar dropdown is a separate source composition.",
    "Arrangements, values, translated RTL labels and nested radio-menu data follow the source. The kit uses its existing Vega styles and Material Symbols rather than importing Nova wrappers or Lucide/Tabler assets.",
    "The existing local portrait replaces the source remote GitHub avatar; no network image load is added.",
    "Menu/Select/Tooltip/Popover routes follow the Gallery native flag: styled independent Flyout or OS menu/platform-themed container as appropriate.",
    "Application actions are local readouts, shared drafts, actual SDK clipboard acknowledgments and an amount preview. No account, recording, payment or Copilot service is connected.",
    "Task popover keeps the source title/editor arrangement but describes local draft ownership instead of claiming a pull request will be created."
  ]
